    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Libertine is a narrative-rich roguelike card game set in the bowels of an illegal underground casino, where the house always takes its cut - in flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/f9238222b182845a0c7ecc645b622540.avif?t=1753985248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off a series of diverse characters in stressful blackjack duels, wagering both chips and the fingers off your hand. Each opponent you face is more than a set of cards. Study each of their personalities and playstyles, learn their tells, and read their intentions with each raise, check, and fold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/2a5592d37a6e6169e5d81112fa288cfa.avif?t=1753985248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategize, bluff and pray luck is on your side. But no matter what, never forget - The house always wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.poster.avif?t=1753985248\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.webm?t=1753985248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.mp4?t=1753985248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Libertine is a narrative-rich roguelike card game set in the bowels of an illegal underground casino, where the house always takes its cut - in flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/f9238222b182845a0c7ecc645b622540.avif?t=1753985248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off a series of diverse characters in stressful blackjack duels, wagering both chips and the fingers off your hand. Each opponent you face is more than a set of cards. Study each of their personalities and playstyles, learn their tells, and read their intentions with each raise, check, and fold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/2a5592d37a6e6169e5d81112fa288cfa.avif?t=1753985248\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategize, bluff and pray luck is on your side. But no matter what, never forget - The house always wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.poster.avif?t=1753985248\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.webm?t=1753985248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729390/extras/acd59da2088d8a7613f5d7305d9bcab5.mp4?t=1753985248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
